    schema1:dateCreated "2017-11-08" ;
    schema1:description "Model-based Analysis of Genome-wide CRISPR-Cas9 Knockout (MAGeCK) is a computational tool to identifyimportant genes from the recent genome-scale CRISPR-Cas9 knockout screens technology." ;
